    "name": "ColumnPath",
    "owner": null,
    "crate": "parquet",
    "version": "59.3.0",
    "kind": "struct",
    "signature": "struct ColumnPath",
    "docs": "Represents the location of a column in a Parquet schema\n\n# Example: refer to column named `'my_column'`\n```\n# use parquet::schema::types::ColumnPath;\nlet column_path = ColumnPath::from(\"my_column\");\n```\n\n# Example: refer to column named `c` in a nested struct `{a: {b: {c: ...}}}`\n```\n# use parquet::schema::types::ColumnPath;\n// form path 'a.b.c'\nlet column_path = ColumnPath::from(vec![\n  String::from(\"a\"),\n  String::from(\"b\"),\n  String::from(\"c\")\n]);\n```",
